  78+ 2034
  79+ 2034              // address for "next" - inner interpreter
  80+ 2034              // This address must always be pointed by IX
  81+ 2034              // "next" macro simply does a  jp(ix)  instruction
  82+ 2034
  83+ 2034              // Psh2_Ptr:       push    de
